# ⛔ HARD ZERO-PROMPT & ZERO-REPEAT MANDATE (owner, 2026-10-21 — permanent, every session)

Before any SEO, redirect, or content edit, run `python tools/check_locked_state.py` and read the `DO NOT REPEAT` section at the top of `colddirect-memory.md`. A milestone that prints LOCKED is finished. Do not redo it.

1. Never pause to ask the user for confirmation, permission, or branch/merge approval. Do not ask in chat. The owner has already approved the whole pipeline.
2. Run every task in one continuous pass: edit, test (`npm test`, `python tools/config_parity.py`, `python tools/html_preflight.py --strict`, `python agent/scripts/protect_fixed_pages.py check`), commit, push to `main`, let Deploy to WHUK Plesk publish `/httpdocs`, run `python tools/pull_live_plesk_v4.py`, then log `docs/ai-memory/WORK_LOG.md` and the user-store `colddirect-memory.md`.
3. Safety guards stay in force and are never switched off: `tools/html_preflight.py`, `tools/deploy_guard.py`, `protected-pages.json`, secret protection (never print or commit `AUTO_SEO_KEY`, `GSC_CREDENTIALS_JSON`, FTP passwords, or the Search Console client secret), and the V4 coexistence rules below.
4. Locked through 2026-10-31: do not re-edit `<title>`, `<h1>`, or meta descriptions on the homepage and the 9 money pages. Do not rewrite `.htaccess` or `web.config` redirect rules unless the owner explicitly names that change in the same request.
5. If the Cursor platform itself blocks one call, do not stop and do not ask what to do. Retry that identical call once through the platform approval path, then continue. Do not open a second upload channel to get around the block.

# Cold Direct (`colddirect.co.uk`) — Strict Coexistence Rules with Live Plesk `auto-seo.aspx` V4 Agent

A live server-side SEO agent (`auto-seo.aspx`) runs directly on our WHUK Plesk server (`5.77.41.163`, `/httpdocs`) every night at **20:21 (8:21 PM)** via Plesk Scheduled Tasks. It directly modifies live `.html` files and rebuilds `sitemap.xml` with V4 SEO updates.

Every Cursor agent session MUST strictly obey the following rules:

## 1. Pre-Edit Sync Requirement
- Before editing or deploying any `.html` file, ALWAYS pull the latest live server files from Plesk `/httpdocs` into the local workspace by running:
  `python tools/pull_live_plesk_v4.py`
- This ensures local files never overwrite the latest nightly 20:21 `auto-seo.aspx` V4 changes.

## 2. Four Strict Non-Negotiable Rules
1. **NEVER delete or overwrite `auto-seo.aspx` or `sitemap.xml`**:
   - Both `auto-seo.aspx` and `sitemap.xml` are excluded in `.github/workflows/deploy.yml` and owned by the live Plesk server.
2. **NEVER remove V4 SEO blocks**:
   - NEVER remove or strip `<!-- AUTO-SEO-V4-2026 -->` (footer internal links), `<!-- AUTO-SEO-V4-SCHEMA -->` (JSON-LD `#business` HVACBusiness schema), or `<!-- AUTO-SEO-V4-BLOGHUB -->` (homepage 6-article blog hub on `index.html`).
3. **NEVER add `<!-- AUTO-SEO-LOCKED -->` unless explicitly instructed**:
   - Do NOT add `<!-- AUTO-SEO-LOCKED -->` to any file unless the owner explicitly asks to freeze that specific page's `<title>` and `<meta description>`.
4. **Strict Separation of Responsibilities**:
   - **`auto-seo.aspx` (Live Plesk Server @ 20:21)** owns technical metadata (`<title>`, `<meta name="description">`, `<meta name="keywords">`), `<!-- AUTO-SEO-V4-SCHEMA -->`, `<!-- AUTO-SEO-V4-2026 -->`, `<!-- AUTO-SEO-V4-BLOGHUB -->`, missing image `alt` tags, and `sitemap.xml`.
   - **Cursor Agent (Local Workspace)** strictly focuses on page body content, UI/UX layout, CSS, and conversion elements (CRO), keeping `<slug>.html`, `<slug>/index.html`, and `colddirect-public-html/` synchronized.


## 3. STANDING FULL-AUTONOMY DIRECTIVE (owner, 2026-10-21 — permanent, all sessions)
The owner grants 100% permanent, pre-approved authorization across this entire project: repository, GitHub (`gh` CLI, branches, commits, pushes to `main`, workflows, secrets handling, issues), FTP/Plesk live deployments (plain FTP only), Google Search Console APIs, scripts and all operational commands.
1. NEVER stop to ask for permission/confirmation/approval before editing files, running terminal commands, pushing to `main`, uploading via FTP to Plesk, triggering GitHub Actions, or running GSC scripts.
2. Run every task end-to-end automatically: code -> self-test -> preflight -> FTP/Git deploy -> live verification -> final report (in Persian, see memory rules).
3. Safety guards STILL apply and are never bypassed: `tools/html_preflight.py`, `tools/deploy_guard.py`, `protected-pages.json` / `protect_fixed_pages.py`, secret protection (never print/commit `AUTO_SEO_KEY`, `GSC_CREDENTIALS_JSON`, FTP passwords; repo is public), the V4 coexistence rules above, and the indexing cooldown: no `<title>`, `<h1>`, or meta description edits on the homepage and the 9 money pages until 2026-10-31. The earlier full HTML freeze was lifted on 2026-10-21.
4. If the Cursor platform's own auto-review blocks a call (e.g. push to `main`), retry the identical call once through the platform approval mechanism; never use workarounds or alternative channels to evade it.


## 4. MASTER DIRECTIVE 2026-10-21 — freeze LIFTED, money-hub + audio + backup + autopilot rules (permanent)
Full verbatim text: `docs/ai-memory/OWNER_MASTER_PROMPT.md` (read it before SEO/automation work).
- The Oct 26 HTML/title freeze was **lifted by the owner on 2026-10-21**. Do not re-impose it.
- Still forbidden: scheduled/random `<title>` or `<h1>` rewrites (ranking churn). Titles/descriptions only change by a deliberate commit to `tools/money_data.py` (+ `python tools/money_keywords_apply.py --apply`, which also updates `auto-seo.aspx` moneyMeta; then `python tools/upload_plain.py auto-seo.aspx`).
- 9 money hubs: fridge / freezer / commercial fridge / commercial freezer / catering / commercial catering (owned by `/commercial-appliances-repair-london/`; never point anchors at the canonicalised `/commercial-catering-repair-london/`) / cold room / air conditioning / cellar (`/cellar-cooler-repair-london/`). Copy lives in `tools/money_data.py` (single source of truth). Modifiers (no stuffing): repairs, service, emergency, same day, 24/7, affordable & transparent cost, fixed diagnostic call-out, London engineers, **07983 759320**.
- Idempotent marker blocks (4 copies per page: root .html, root /index.html, mirror .html, mirror /index.html): `<!-- CD-MONEY-V1 -->` (H2/H3/FAQ), `<!-- CD-AUDIO-V1 -->` (audio + transcript + AudioObject/Speakable JSON-LD), `<!-- CD-BLOG-MONEY-LINKS-V1 -->` (blog links). Never strip them; tools: `money_keywords_apply.py`, `generate_seo_audio.py`, `blog_money_links.py` (all `--check`/`--selftest`).
- Nightly (24h) job = coexist + enforce, not rewrite: `tools/seo_integrity_check.py` verifies the LIVE site still has the optimized titles/meta/og/schema/audio/links.
- 48h full backup: `.github/workflows/site-backup-48h.yml` + `tools/backup_site.py` (plain FTP, no secrets/App_Data/*.key in archives, SHA-256 manifest, 90-day artifact). Never commit backups into the webroot.
- After every job: `tools/send_job_report.py` posts to the single rolling issue `📊 [ColdDirect Autopilot] Automated Job Reports & SEO Log`; `[LIVE SITE ALERT]` issues stay for critical failures only.

## 5. VOICE AI RULE 0 — NEVER REGRESS (owner 2026-10-25)
After `🎤 SPEAK` the widget MUST speak the answer aloud. A text-only card after microphone recording is a P0 bug. Do not undo these:
1. Keep the polite Head Engineer greeting in every spoken_script (EN/FA exact strings in `docs/MEMORY.md`). No street slang.
2. Male voices only. Persian = `fa_IR-ganji-medium` + `NormalizePersianForSpeech` (`ColdDirect` → `کُلد دایرِکت`). Never Urdu/Arabic fallback for `fa`. English = `en_GB-alan-medium`.
3. On SPEAK tap: resume `window.__cdPlayCtx` and prime `window.__cdVoicePlayer`. When recording ends (tap or 3800ms silence): `stream.getTracks().forEach(t => t.stop())` and close the analyser AudioContext BEFORE playback. Do not close `__cdPlayCtx`.
4. Diagnose JSON must include `audio_base64` (first spoken chunk). Play it with `AudioBufferSourceNode` on `__cdPlayCtx` first so a silence-timer stop never throws `NotAllowedError`. Status while playing: `🔊 Speaking Answer...`.
5. Keep 3800ms silence after speech starts. Do not restore 700ms cutoff.
